le Ads</h2><p data-v-480388d2>Google Ads API provider contract for customers, budgets, campaigns, ad groups, assets, ads, reporting, and conversions.</p></a><div class="integration-card__capabilities" data-v-480388d2><!--[--><span data-v-480388d2>Campaign Management</span><span data-v-480388d2>Creative Operations</span><!--]--><span data-v-480388d2>+1</span></div><footer data-v-480388d2><a href="/library/integrations/google-ads/" class="" data-v-480388d2>10 actions <span aria-hidden="true" data-v-480388d2>→</span></a><a href="https://ads.google.com/home/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-v-480388d2> Visit tool <span aria-hidden="true" data-v-480388d2>↗</span></a></footer></article><article class="integration-card" style="--integration-color:#ffbd5c;" data-v-e8ad8468 data-v-480388d2><div class="integration-card__top" data-v-480388d2><span class="integration-mark is-small has-logo" style="--mark-color:#ffbd5c;" aria-hidden="true" data-v-480388d2 data-v-aa7c01f7><img src="/images/integrations/meta-icon.png" alt="" data-v-aa7c01f7></span><span data-v-480388d2>Media Buying</span></div><a href="/library/integrations/meta-ads/" class="integration-card__body" data-v-480388d2><h2 data-v-480388d2>Meta Ads</h2><p data-v-480388d2>Meta Marketing API provider contract for ad accounts, campaigns, ad sets, ads, creatives, and insights.</p></a><div class="integration-card__capabilities" data-v-480388d2><!--[--><span data-v-480388d2>Campaign Management</span><span data-v-480388d2>Creative Operations</span><!--]--><span data-v-480388d2>+1</span></div><footer data-v-480388d2><a href="/library/integrations/meta-ads/" class="" data-v-480388d2>15 actions <span aria-hidden="true" data-v-480388d2>→</span></a><a href="https://www.facebook.com/business/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-v-480388d2> Visit tool <span aria-hidden="true" data-v-480388d2>↗</span></a></footer></article><article class="integration-card" style="--integration-color:#ffbd5c;" data-v-e8ad8